  "text": "### 8.1 Maintaining Independence  \n**Safeguards:**\n- No operational responsibilities\n- No decision-making authority\n- No conflict of interest roles\n- Separate reporting to Board Audit Committee\n- Budget approved by Board (not management)\n- Staff appraisals reviewed by Board chair  \n**Prohibited Activities:**\n- Internal Audit staff cannot audit departments where recently managed\n- Internal Audit staff cannot audit their own work\n- Internal Audit staff cannot approve transactions or controls they audit\n- Internal Audit cannot advise on strategy (can audit strategic decisions)",
